silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_sous_observation_role #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Sous: The Under-Reading Observation Role' the bare symbol Mittens anchors to MittensVetRecordDependsOnCitationKey: The dependency arrow: the published claim depends on the citation key, which depends on the source-boundary declaration; reversing this would create a cycle and break acyclicity.." .
